sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant M as Manager Client
    participant G as Managers API (Gateway)
    participant C as ManagerMetricsController
    participant R as Shared Redis Cluster
    participant A as Aggregation Service
    participant D as Directory Repository
    participant S as Session Repository
    participant MR as Metrics Repository

    Note over M,C: Retrieve team-level KPIs — users per team, team sessions, active users\nRequest includes orgId, teamId, time-range (from,to)

    M->>G: GET /orgs/{orgId}/teams/{teamId}/metrics?from=&to=
    G->>C: Forward request (orgId, teamId, from, to)

    C->>R: GET cache["team_metrics", teamId, from, to]
    alt Cache hit
        R-->>C: Return cached metrics
        C-->>G: 200 OK + metrics
        G-->>M: 200 OK + metrics
    else Cache miss
        par Compute Team User Counts
            C->>A: getTeamUserCounts(orgId, teamId, from, to)
            A->>D: countUsersInTeam(teamId)
            D-->>A: totalUsers
            A->>S: countActiveUsersInTeam(teamId, from, to)
            S-->>A: activeUsers
            A-->>C: {totalUsers, activeUsers}
        and Compute Team Sessions
            C->>MR: getPreAggregatedSessions(teamId, from, to)
            alt Pre-aggregated available
                MR-->>C: totalSessions
            else No pre-aggregation
                C->>S: countTeamSessions(teamId, from, to)
                S-->>C: totalSessions
            end
        end

        C->>R: SET cache["team_metrics", teamId, from, to] = {metrics} TTL=15m
        C-->>G: 200 OK + computed metrics
        G-->>M: 200 OK + computed metrics
    end
